From: pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
Subject: Power + volume down takes a screenshot

As on Android: volume down while the power button is held, or the power
button within 700 ms of volume down, takes a screenshot through Phosh's
screenshot manager, and the power button's release does not blank the
screen. The volume popup the key brings up is closed and held off for
1.5 s (the volume daemon may still ask for it after us), and the picture
is taken 250 ms later, once the popup is off the screen.
